      "writtenOn": "2026-01-06T20:43:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Another solution would be to refactor the `ResolveDeferredExpectectationsNow` code to not destroy the first device. Instead, stop the capture, make a 2nd device (if it doesn\u0027t already exist), replay the capture to this 2nd device, check those expectations, start a new capture, then continue.",
