      "writtenOn": "2026-01-07T09:13:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah sorry I should have detailed more. The reason there is a `ResolveDeferredExpectationsNow` is because the takes takes too long because it runs three levels of loops on `format x mipLevel x arrayLayer` (from what the comment says). With `DAWN_INSTANTIATE_TEST_P` we could turn this into a DawnTest instantiation per format (or per format and miplevel) such that the runtime stays reasonable and we don\u0027t need the `ResolveDeferredExpectationsNow` call.\n\nDoing what Gregg suggested would also be a good idea.",
      "parentUuid": "13d848b9_7a9b3fc1",
